cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "ovd-under-canopy: open-vocabulary detection of missing persons and belongings under forest canopy"
abstract: >-
  Code for the NeurIPS 2026 VLM4RWD workshop paper. Four open-vocabulary
  detectors are fine-tuned with LoRA on a six-class forest search-and-rescue
  benchmark and measured under one frozen protocol, with query-sensitivity flip
  rates alongside standard AP.
